@startuml PROV_O
' Class/property view of the exact local PROV-O core imported by webuild.ttl.
' Source: ../imports/prov-o/prov-o-20130430.ttl (2013-04-30; approved local correction).
' Import resolution: catalog-v001.xml; pin/correction: ../imports/manifest.json.
' Style reference: Archive/authorisation_part.PlantUML.
' This is a class/property view, not a complete rendering of every OWL axiom.
' All 30 PROV classes, 44 object properties, 6 datatype properties and 28 named subclass axioms are shown.
' Annotation properties, property chains and the subproperty hierarchy are omitted.
' No WEBUILD alignment or application-profile requirement is asserted.

title PROV-O Class Model — WEBUILD Imported Core
caption Pinned 2013-04-30 core · local copy approved 23 November 2026 · prov: = http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#

skinparam groupInheritance 2
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam ArrowColor DarkRed
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 70
hide circle

legend top left
  <back:LightYellow><color:DarkRed> PROV-O class </color></back>    <back:#CEEED0><color:#285F17> Display expression / external OWL class </color></back>
  All member names use the prov: namespace. + property: available; no minimum cardinality is asserted by this notation.
  Solid arrow: object property (source member to range). Hollow triangle: rdfs:subClassOf.
  Green union boxes abbreviate OWL expressions; they are not additional named classes.
  Repeated boxes with the same class name are references to that same class.
  Inherited members apply to subclasses. No UML multiplicities are invented.
  WEBUILD reuses prov:Agent directly. Extension Role and RoleFulfillment are not mapped to PROV classes.
endlegend

