note bottom of ActivityInfluence
  OWL restriction: prov:hadActivity max 0.
  Use prov:activity to identify the influencing Activity.
end note

note bottom of Influence
  Additional domain axioms (intersection with Influence):
  prov:hadActivity: Delegation OR Derivation OR End OR Start.
  prov:hadRole: Association OR InstantaneousEvent.
  These are domain inferences, not mandatory properties.
end note

note bottom of EmptyCollection
  Also declared owl:NamedIndividual in the imported source (punning).
  No hadMember max 0 restriction is asserted in this OWL file.
end note

note as Axioms
  <b>Other class / inverse axioms</b>
  Disjoint: Activity / Entity; Agent / InstantaneousEvent;
  Entity / InstantaneousEvent; ActivityInfluence / EntityInfluence.
  Inverse pairs: generated / wasGeneratedBy;
  invalidated / wasInvalidatedBy; influenced / wasInfluencedBy.
  The domain/range of influenced follow from its inverse.
  prov:value has no explicit range in the source (Literal shown).
  wasRevisionOf and specializationOf are object properties;
  only their duplicate annotation declarations were removed.
end note

@enduml
